    "title": "Sandra Panek shares recent tweets addressing public engagement",
    "text": "Sandra Panek, a New Hampshire State Representative, recently posted a series of tweets addressing various topics. The tweets, published between October 12 and October 14, 2025, reflect her ongoing engagement with constituents and the public on social media.\nOn October 12, 2025, Panek shared a tweet, which can be accessed at this link.\nShortly after, on the same day, she posted another tweet, available at this link.\nTwo days later, on October 14, 2025, Panek published a third tweet. The content is accessible at this link.\nSandra Panek serves as a state representative in New Hampshire, a role that involves legislative responsibilities and constituent outreach. Social media platforms like X (formerly Twitter) are commonly used by public officials to communicate directly with the public and share updates on their activities and positions.",
